  "description": "The story of a man who swallowed the darkness and a man who lost his light Inkyung, who lived in the cold and cruel darkness, reunited with Eunsoo at Sekwang's office but Inkyung avoided him. Eunsoo, was a light in the school days. Eunsoo, became a gangster in favor of Sekwang because he wanted to be beside Inkyung. Unlike the disturbing Inkyung, the eyes of Eunsoo was shining. \"That day you lost your shining eyes, and I lost you who was shining.\" \n\n(Source: Netcomics)",
